    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Gmail AI Labeler Lite\nEvery new email is read by AI, sorted into a label (AI/Sales lead, AI/Customer support, AI/Billing, AI/Newsletter...), summarised in one line and logged to a Google Sheet with its urgency and whether it needs a reply. It never sends or deletes email.\n\n**Setup (about 10 minutes)**\n1. Make a Google Sheet with a tab `Inbox log` and these headers: processed_at, from, subject, category, urgency, needs_reply, summary, message_id\n2. Open **Settings**: your name and business, sheet URL.\n3. Connect credentials: Gmail, OpenAI, Google Sheets.\n4. Activate. Labels are created automatically the first time they're needed.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "dabe10b3-a65c-50ca-b425-4d137801491c",
      "name": "Note: start here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Full version adds\n- Reply drafts saved in Gmail Drafts, in your tone and with your facts, for you to check and send\n- Instant alert email for sales leads and urgent mail\n- Loop protection for its own alerts\n\n**Want it installed for you?** I set up the full version on your own accounts. Message me through my n8n Creator profile.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "1d373de2-1f97-5080-a95a-a1d15b4d4d71",
      "name": "Note: full version",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
